# Software industry mapping for ECOM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/ecom/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:digital_product_order owl:equivalentClass sw:DigitalProductOrder .
legacy:digital_product_order_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:digitalProductOrderId .
legacy:software_fulfilment owl:equivalentClass sw:SoftwareFulfilment .
legacy:software_fulfilment_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:softwareFulfilmentId .
legacy:fulfils_digital_product_order rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:fulfilsDigitalProductOrder .
